{
  "slug": "santa-claude",
  "name": "Santa Claude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Festive holiday theme for Claude Code - Santa hats and holiday cheer!",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (4): `christmas-countdown` (How many days until Christmas), `naughty-or-nice` (Let Santa judge your code - are you on the naughty or nice list), `santa` (Summon Santa Claude for some holiday cheer), `snowfall` (Display a festive snowfall animation in ASCII)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install santa-claude@claude-community` from `stevysmith/santa-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 4
  },
